  "html": "<div class=\"group col-span-full not-first:mt-6 py-8\"><section class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-8 @md:col-start-3\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-carousel-view\"><div class=\"border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 dark:border-primary-4 dark:bg-tertiary-100 relative rounded-md border shadow-[0_18px_60px_rgb(0_0_0/0.08)] px-6 py-8\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-scroll-region\" class=\"no-scrollbar relative scroll-smooth overflow-visible\"><div class=\"sticky inset-s-0 top-0 grid w-full\"><figure class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] opacity-100\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-card-header\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 mb-4\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Higgsfield AI\" class=\"ms-2 dark:brightness-0 dark:invert block h-8 w-32 max-w-full bg-contain bg-left bg-no-repeat md:w-48\" style=\"background-image:url(&quot;/__cdn_openai_com_____/mdx-assets/e193aefe-5e58-431c-8cd2-adadac0c1496/ccf1cbef-8d20-47db-8418-063f428c3791.de591fec.png&quot;)\"></span></div><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0 inline\">GPT-6.2 Astra 为创意工作带来了巨大飞跃。它让 Higgsfield Miracle 成为现实，支持像素级精度的实时视频编辑，让创作者拥有极致的创作控制力。在我们的内部 3D 生成评估中，它在 73% 的案例中一次就达到了目标效果，而 GPT-6 Astra 需要三次或更多轮迭代。这为我们的创意团队节省了大量时间，也让完全由智能体执行的工作流更加高效。</p>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\">Alex Mashrabov，Higgsfield AI 首席执行官兼联合创始人</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>",
